  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>About our brand and products:</strong> Beauty House is an online perfume store. We carry thousands of designer, niche, and Middle Eastern fragrances at great prices, including popular brands like Rayhaan and Khadlaj.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>What makes us different:</strong> We have one of the biggest selections of Middle Eastern perfumes in the US, which is one of the fastest growing categories in beauty right now. Our products already do really well on social media.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong> You earn commission on every sale that comes through your link or coupon code. Perfume orders tend to be larger than average, so payouts add up fast.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong> Fragrance content does great on TikTok, Instagram, and YouTube. Reviews, first impressions, and fragrance unboxing type videos all work well. We're happy to suggest products and trending picks.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><strong>Other information:</strong> We ship across the US and launch new fragrances all the time, so there's always something new to talk about.</p><div style=\"margin-bottom:0px;\"><div style=\"height:1562px;width:100%;position:relative;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;top:1082px;left:0px;width:100%;\"><div><div><div class=\"group\" style=\"height:auto;\"><div class=\"contents\"><div class=\"group relative pb-[var(--msg-assistant-pb,0.75rem)]\"><div class=\"font-claude-response relative leading-[1.65rem] [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:bg-bg-000/50 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-0.5 [&amp;_pre&gt;div]:border-border-400 [&amp;_.ignore-pre-bg&gt;div]:bg-transparent [&amp;_.standard-markdown_:is(p,blockquote,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6)]:pl-2